<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Nov official reserves S$106.3 bln - MAS.</title>
<headline>Singapore Nov official reserves S$106.3 bln - MAS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official foreign reserves</p>
<p>(billions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>						 Nov 96    Oct 96     Nov 95</p>
<p>    Total official reserves	    106.28    105.82     96.87</p>
<p>    Gold and foreign exchange</p>
<p>    reserves				 105.60    105.15     96.20</p>
<p>    Special drawing rights (million)  249.5     245.1     240.1</p>
<p>    Reserve Position in IMF (million) 428.8     428.8     430.3</p>
<p>Source: Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS)</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
